```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

May 7, 2024
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-20-24 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne
and Simon Contractors, for the Public Works Improvements Project
______________________________________________
Bid #S-20-24 was solicited for the Public Works Improvements project (Project Vicinity Map
included).

Five (5) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1. Simon Contractors
2. JTL Group Inc. d/b/a Knife River
3. Resource Construction LLC
4. Reiman Corp.
5. S&S Builders LLC

The bids were reviewed by Adele Bartel (Public Works), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), and Vicki
Nemecek (Public Works) and their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from
Simon Contractors.

The total Bid Award is $2,377,017.25

Project Completion is scheduled for October 31, 2025.

Funding:

101-14-1415-40-43501 (Fleet Maintenance Fund / Improvements)

$647,706.00
020-26-2615-40-21601 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Maintenance / Muni. Building)
$124,140.50
020-26-2617-42-21601 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Maintenance / Traffic)

$212,940.50
023-14-1424-43-43501 (Solid Waste Fund / Improvements / Landfill)

$380,520.75
023-14-1417-43-43501 (Solid Waste Fund / Improvements / Sanitation)
$108,870.75
020-26-2616-42-21601 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Maintenance / Street & Alley)
$902,838.75
```

